TITLE  X-ray emission from a silver disc.
       .
       >>>>>>>> Source definition.
SKPAR  4              [Primary particles: 1=e-, 2=ph, 3=e+, 4=h, 5=a]
SENERG 10.0e6           [Initial energy (monoenergetic sources only)]
SPOSIT 0 0 0                              [Coordinates of the source]
SCONE  0 0 0                            [Conical beam; angles in deg]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Material data and simulation parameters.
MFNAME Cu.mat                         [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 5e3 5e3 5e3 0.10 0.10 5e3 5e3      [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 5e3            [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Geometry definition file.
GEOMFN disc.geo                       [Geometry file, up to 20 chars]
PARINP  1  0.03                     thickness [Replacement parameter]
PARINP  2  0.03                        radius [Replacement parameter]
DSMAX   1 1e-4                   [KB, maximum step length in body KB]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Interaction forcing.
IFORCE 1 1 3  5  0.9 1.1                [KB,KP,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 1 1 4  5  0.9 1.1                [KB,KP,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 1 4 5  5  0.9 1.1                [KB,KP,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Bremsstrahlung splitting.
IBRSPL 1 2                                      [KB,splitting factor]
       .
       >>>>>>>> X-ray splitting.
IXRSPL 1 2                                      [KB,splitting factor]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Emerging particles. Energy and angular distributions.
NBE    5e3 5e6   499                  [Energy window and no. of bins]
NBANGL 45 18               [No. of bins for the angles THETA and PHI]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Outer angular detectors (up to 5).
ANGDET 90 180 0 360                   [Angular window, angles in deg]
ADENER 5e3 10e3 500                  [Energy window and no. of bins]
ADKPAR 2                                 [Type of detected particles]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Dose distribution.
GRIDZ   0.0  0.03  101    [Z coords of the box vertices, no. of bins]
GRIDR   0.03 101             [Radius of the dose volume, no. of bins]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Job properties
RESUME dump.dmp                [Resume from this dump file, 20 chars]
DUMPTO dump.dmp                   [Generate this dump file, 20 chars]
DUMPP  60                                    [Dumping period, in sec]
       .
LTRACK 25                   [Generate shower files for visualisation]
       .
NSIMSH 3e6                      [Desired number of simulated showers]
TIME   2e9                         [Allotted simulation time, in sec]
